# Extra trust anchors for pipeline/ingest.py — public CA roots that this machine's
# Windows root store has not cached yet. Windows/schannel downloads these on demand
# (which is why browsers work); python's ssl only sees roots already in the store, so
# the chain dead-ends with 'unable to get local issuer certificate'. Adding the root
# here restores the OS-intended trust decision without weakening verification.
#
# Sectigo Public Server Authentication Root E46  — issuer of the CA OV E36 intermediate
# that www.ecb.europa.eu (feed 'ecb') serves. Self-signed, valid 2021-03-22..2046-03-21.
